<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Atesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Atesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Atesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tes</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Atesalonike</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Pauli kwa Atesalonike</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Balua yi' niandike nenga na Pauli, pamope na Silwano na Timoteo, kwa kipi'nga sa kanisa lya ku Tesalonike, mwenga nga mwabandu bake Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Tunnu'bya ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu, na kwa Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu ya nsimu wo isa kwake Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Mwalongo bitu, tupalikwa tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' masu'ba goti kwa kitumbu sinu. Kwitu twenga yendapwaika panga nyo, kwa mwanjaa imani no pendana kwinu mwabene na bene kwendaku'la muno. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Twendakwipunia mumakanisa ga Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa mutikomeya muimani kwo pi'tya ngu'su'mbu' na siki yamwaipatike.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Ago goti galaya panga ukumu ya Nnu'ngu' nga ya aki. Mwenga mwatikomea mungu'su'mbu' kwa kitumbu sa kummi'ka wiso muukulungwa wake. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Nnu'ngu' mwene aki aali'pa ngu'su'mbu' boti babantesa, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>na kumpeya kipu'mu'lyo mwenga mwamuku'su'mbu'lwa, pamope na twenga. Aapanga go nsimu wa isa Bwana Yesu bu'ka kunani pamope na malaika bake bene makakala. <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>Yesu aalu'a kwabukiya kwa malimi ga mwoto boti babankana Nnu'ngu' na babakotoka kwiyu'wa Abali Inannoga ya Bwana witu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Ukumu yabe yaaba yo langamiswa milele no bi'ki'lwa kuutalu na Bwana na utukupu waulayilwe na uweso wake. <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>Lisu'ba lyaalu'a isa Yesu aakwi'yi'lwa no pokya isima bu'ka kwa apeleteu babamwu'bi'lile. Kai' mwenga nyinyonyo mwaaba pamope nabo kwa mwanjaa mwiu'bi'li abali yatwannetile.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Kwa kitumbu so, tukotokali kunnu'bya panga Nnu'ngu' witu annyangatiye mukombwe tama kati mwamukemilwe. Kai' tunnu'ba atimise manugio ginu goti kwa uweso wake kwo panga makowe manogau, no panga lyengo linu lyoti lya imani. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Tulu'ba nyo li'nga lina lya Bwana witu Yesu likwi'yi'lwe kwo pi'tya mwenga. Kai', nyinyonyo mukwi'yi'lwe kwo pi'tya ywembe. Ago gaapangika bu'kana na ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' witu na ya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yu'lu' Nnau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Nambi'yambi' mwalongo bitu, tupala longela bu'kana no buyangana kwa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, na mwatwaalu'a kongolekana li'nga tama pamope nakwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>Tunnu'ba kanemuyu'ngu'ye nyopa no ba na kyukala mana mwayu'wa lisu'ba lyo buya kwa Bwana Yesu litimile. Mala yi'ngi' muyu'wine go muabali ya ulondoli, au go ala, au ga balua yaibayilwa panga yumi kasitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Kanemuyi'ki'ti mundu ywoywoti ankonge kwa likowe lyolyoti. Kwa mwanjaa lisu'ba lyo lyaisali pangali wi'ti' bandu baingi kunkana Nnu'ngu', kai' Mundu Nnau, ywaalu'a langamiswa muno, aabonekana. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Ywembe wi'ti' aalu'a kana na kwibi'ka panani ya kila kili'be sakikemelwa nnu'ngu' na kukikilikitya. Kai' aalu'a yingya no tama mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na kwikwi'ya panga ywembe nga Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Buli, muku'mbu'kyali panga naatikummakianga aga goti nsimu panaabile pamope na mwenga? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Mwenga mutangite panga kibile kili'be sakinkanikiya aywo Mundu Nnau kwa nambi'yambi', li'nga abonekane kwa nsimu waupalikwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Ata nambi'yambi' makakala ga ulau gagaiyilwe gapanga kasi. Lakini, aabonekali mpaka yu'lu' ywankanikiya aabu'yi'lwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Apo Mundu Nnau ngaalu'a pitya. Lakini Bwana Yesu aammulaga kwa mbu'mwo bai, na kunnangamisa kwa utukupu wo isa kwake. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Isa kwake Mundu Nnau ywo lyapanga lyengo lya Ibilisi kwo pi'tya makakala, myanju na mangelongelo ga ubu'su'. <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>Aakonga kwa kila sampuli ya ulau balu' boti bababile mundi'la yo oba. Bembe bakana kuuyi'ki'tya ukakape li'nga bapate kosopolelwa. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Kwa nyo Nnu'ngu' aalei bakongelwe li'nga bau'bi'li ubu'su'. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Apo, boti bangali u'bi'lya ukakape no pulaikya sambi, baalu'a ukumilwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Musaulilwe li'nga mukosopolelwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Lakini mwalongo mwamupendilwe na Bwana, tupalikwa kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' pangali kotoka kwa kitumbu sinu mwenga. Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aatikunsawa bu'ka kwai'mbu' li'nga mupoki ukosopoli kwo peleteyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu, na kwa kuu'bi'lya ukakape. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Nnu'ngu' aatikunkema li'nga mupoki ukosopoli wo kwa ndi'la ya Abali Inannoga yatwaalike kasinu. Ankemite li'nga mupoki utukupu wa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Nambi'yambi' mwalongo bitu, muyi'me kwo kangamala na kugakamwa mayi'gano gamupoki kwa ndi'la ya maalo gitu au kwa balua yitu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Tunnu'ba Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu mwene na Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu, ywatupendile na kwa ngu'ngu' yake ngatupeya amani yangayomoka na mau'bi'lyo manogau, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>aasenge na kunkangamaya, li'nga mukombwe longela no panga manogau goti.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mutulu'byange kwa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Nambi'yambi' mwalongo, mutulu'bi li'nga Liyi'gi'yo lya Bwana liyendeli bamba kwa kiyu'ngu'ya, kai' bandu balipoki kwa isima kati mwayabile kasinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Mutulu'bi li'nga Nnu'ngu' atuli'ndi'le bu'ka kwa bandu abaya na alau, kwa mwanjaa botili babau'bi'lya.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Lakini Bwana Yesu nga ywau'bi'li'ka, aalu'a kunkangamaya mwenga na kunni'ndi'la bu'ka kwa yu'lu' nnau, Ibilisi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Na twenga tubile na mau'bi'lyo bu'ka kwa Bwana bu'kana na mwenga panga, mupanga kati mwatulagya na kai' mwayendelya kugapanga.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Bwana alongoye myoyo yinu muupendo wa Nnu'ngu' na muukomeyi waubu'ka kwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makowe go panga kasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Mwalongo bitu, tunnagya kwa lina lya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu panga, mutame kuutalu na alongo boti akataa, babakotoka koleya mayi'gano gatwaapeile. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Mwenga mutangite panga mupalikwa kutuyiga twenga. Patwaabile pamope na mwenga twaaili twaakata, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>wala twaalileli kilyo sa mundu pangali kukili'pya. Paali pake, twapangite kasi kwo kasana kilo na muntwekati, li'nga twakanekunnyegekya mundu ywoywoti kasinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Yali'ngani twenga longa kili'be bu'ka kasinu, lakini twapangiteli nyo li'nga tube twabandu bo yigilwa na mwenga. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Patwaabile pamope na mwenga, twaannagi panga, “Mundu ywoywoti ywakana panga kasi kanealye.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Tulongela nyo kwa mwanjaa tuyu'wine panga babile bi'ngi' kasinu akataa. Bapangali lyengo lyolyoti, ila baauya bandu kwa kwiyingiya mumakowe gangali gabe. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Bandu bo twendakwalagya na kwakwi'li'ka kwa lina lya Bwana Yesu Kilisitu panga bapange kasi kwo tu'ya li'nga bapate kilyo sabe bene.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Lakini mwenga mwalongo bitu, kanemutotokelwe panga manogau. <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Manaitei mundu ywoywoti aakana kugakamwa gatugalagile mubalua yitu yi'no, munninguli wiso mundu ywo. Kanemuyangabanike nakwe li'nga aisike. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Kanemwammalangi kati nndumu, ila munkwi'li'ke kati nnongo.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gi'yo ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Nambi'yambi', Bwana wa amani ampei mwenga amani masu'ba goti na ndi'la yoti. Ywembe abe pamope na mwenga mwaboti.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Nenga na Pauli nimwandikya mwenga nsisingwa gu'no wa kuundi'la kwa luboko lwangu' namwene. Ayo nga saini yangu' mubalua yangu' yoti, na nga mwaniandika.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu ibe pamope na mwenga mwaboti.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
